@startuml P231_oid4vci_issue_authorization_code_ko

'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
' 설정
'- - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - - -
'=== Header and Footer ===
header OPEN-DID 기술 규격
footer
  	Page %page% of %lastpage% at %date("yyyy-MM-dd hh:mm:ss")
end footer

'=== 제목 ===
title
	<size:25>P231 : OID4VCI VC 발급 (Authorization Code)</size>
end title

'=== 옵션 ===
' 자동채번: ex) "<b>000." => 앞에 0을 채워 3자리 숫자로 표시
autonumber "<b>(#)</b>"
' 페이지 하단 participant box 숨기기
'hide footbox

'=== 상수 ===

!$refdoc = "별도 문서 참조"
!$doc = "데이터명세 문서 참조"

'=== Panticipants ===
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 20
skinparam MaxMessageSize 500
skinparam MinClassWidth 80

actor "**사용자**" as user
box 모바일 #OldLace
    participant "**월렛**" as wal <<Wallet>>
end box

box 발급 사업자 #AliceBlue
    participant "**발급 서비스**" as svc <<Server>> #WhiteSmoke
    participant "**Credential Issuer**" as ci <<Server>>
    participant "**Authorization Server**" as as <<Server>>
end box

box 신뢰저장소
    participant "**blockchain**" as BC <<Storage>> #WhiteSmoke
end box

|||
== P231-1 : Credential Offer 생성 ==

svc -> ci ++: Credential Offer 생성 요청\n{grantType = authorization_code,\n credential_configuration_id, offerType, scheme}
    ci -> ci: requestId 생성
    ci -> ci: Credential Offer URI 생성
    rnote right of ci #MintCream
        **credential_offer_uri**
        {credential_issuer}/credential-offer/{requestId}/{configuration_id}
    end note
return {qrImage, qrData}
svc -> user: QR 코드 표시
note right of svc
    Authorization Code 흐름은 사용자가 Authorization Server에서
    직접 로그인하므로 Pre-Authorized Code와 tx_code를 생성하지 않는다.
end note

|||
== P231-2 : Credential Offer 조회 ==

user -> wal: QR 스캔
activate wal
wal -> ci ++: GET credential_offer_uri
    ci -> ci: issuer_state 생성
return Credential Offer
rnote right of wal #MintCream
    **CredentialOffer**
    credential_issuer | credential_configuration_ids |
    grants.authorization_code = { issuer_state }
end note
note right of ci
    Authorization Code 흐름의 Credential Offer는
    저장하지 않으며 다시 조회할 수 있다.
end note

|||
== P231-3 : Metadata 조회 ==

wal -> ci ++: GET /.well-known/openid-credential-issuer
return Credential Issuer Metadata
wal -> as ++: GET /.well-known/oauth-authorization-server
return Authorization Server Metadata\n{authorization_endpoint, token_endpoint, jwks_uri, ...}

|||
== P231-4 : 인가 요청 ==

wal -> as ++: GET {authorization_endpoint}
rnote right of wal #LightGray
    **[API_REQ : Authorization Request]**
    response_type = code
    client_id
    redirect_uri
    scope = openid
    authorization_details (선택)
    issuer_state (Credential Offer의 값, 현재 검증하지 않음)
    state, code_challenge, code_challenge_method (선택)
end note
    as -> user: 로그인 화면
    user -> as: 로그인 (사용자 인증)
    as -> as: 인가 코드(code) 생성
return Redirect {redirect_uri}?code=...&state=...
note right of wal
    redirect_uri는 Authorization Server에 등록된
    Client의 Redirect URI와 같아야 한다.
end note

|||
== P231-5 : Access Token 요청 ==

wal -> as ++: POST {token_endpoint}
rnote right of wal #LightGray
    **[API_REQ : Token 요청]**
    grant_type = authorization_code
    code | redirect_uri | client_id
    Client 인증 (client_secret_basic / client_secret_post)
    또는 code_verifier (PKCE)
end note
    as -> as: 인가 코드 및 Client 확인
    as -> as: access_token 생성\
            \n* sub = 로그인한 사용자
    opt authorization_details 요청 시
        as -> ci ++: Credential Identifier 조회\n{credential_configuration_id}
        return {credential_identifiers}
    end
return Token 응답
rnote right of wal #LightGray
    **[API_RES : Token 응답]**
    access_token | token_type | expires_in
    authorization_details[{credential_configuration_id, credential_identifiers}] (선택)
end note

|||
== P231-6 : c_nonce 요청 및 Credential 요청 ==

wal -> ci ++: POST {nonce_endpoint}
return {c_nonce}
wal -> wal: Proof JWT 생성 및 Holder DID 키로 서명
wal -> ci ++: POST {credential_endpoint}\nAuthorization: Bearer access_token\n{credential_configuration_id, proofs.jwt[]}
    rnote right of ci #MintCream
        Proof 검증, Status List index 할당, Credential 생성 및
        응답 암호화는 P230-6 Credential 요청과 같다.
        사용자 Claim은 access_token의 sub(로그인한 사용자)로 조회한다.
    end note
    ci <-> BC: Holder DID Document 조회 / 응답
return Credential 응답\n{credentials[{credential}]}
wal -> wal: Credential 서명 검증 및 저장
deactivate wal

|||
@enduml
